{"id":"n26144-1-7","stage":2,"title":"중소기업 · 中小企业","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n26144-1-7-1","ko":"무슨 일을 하세요?","zh":"您是做什么工作的呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"1","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}},{"text":"일을","meaning":"事情，工作","explanation":"일：事情，工作；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일을","audio":"/audio/9a5fd6c2b18669a93295.mp3"}},{"text":"하세요?","meaning":"从事，经营","explanation":"하다：从事，经营；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"6","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하세요","audio":"/audio/20c70a963b62c0806108.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"用于询问不确定或不知道的事情、对象、东西等。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"为了实现某事而使用身体或精神的活动；或指该活动的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"从事，经营","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"拥有某种职业或运营某种事业。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f690e6ac32d6f92d822c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n26144-1-7-2","ko":"그냥 조그만 중소기업에 다니는 회사원이에요.","zh":"我就是在一家规模不大的中小企业工作的职员而已。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그냥","meaning":"随便","explanation":"그냥：随便","readings":[{"term":"그냥","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36241","senseId":"4","lemma":"그냥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그냥","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3"}},{"text":"조그만","meaning":"微小","explanation":"조그맣다：微小；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"조그맣다","audio":"/audio/3c1caef850d3fdfbfcff.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91750","senseId":"2","lemma":"조그맣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"조그만","audio":"/audio/2187922fcb97a014ea9e.mp3"}},{"text":"중소기업에","meaning":"中小企业","explanation":"중소기업：中小企业；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"중소기업","audio":"/audio/3f9c626f80691ae26ff4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26144","senseId":"1","lemma":"중소기업","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"중소기업에","audio":"/audio/3e6efcc04d354b3987f2.mp3"}},{"text":"다니는","meaning":"上班，上学，上","explanation":"다니다：上班，上学，上；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"다니다","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29702","senseId":"3","lemma":"다니다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다니는","audio":"/audio/dd9ad12ce6de18d5fef5.mp3"}},{"text":"회사원이에요.","meaning":"公司职员，公司员工","explanation":"회사원：公司职员，公司员工；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"회사원","audio":"/audio/1a0d8fcfa829510f2ed0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88134","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"회사원이에요","audio":"/audio/86b298fde85bb415c747.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e32fb95151ec34cc","term":"그냥","zh":"随便","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3","entryId":"36241","definition":"没有任何想法或别意地。","pronunciation":["그냥"]},{"id":"3c1caef850d3fdfb","term":"조그맣다","zh":"微小","audio":"/audio/3c1caef850d3fdfbfcff.mp3","entryId":"91750","definition":"没什么了不起的。","pronunciation":["조그마타"]},{"id":"3f9c626f80691ae2","term":"중소기업","zh":"中小企业","audio":"/audio/3f9c626f80691ae26ff4.mp3","entryId":"26144","definition":"与大公司相比，资金、员工数量或销售额与规模等相对较小的企